    "text": "Complete combustion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of ethane gives <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>22</mn></msup><mtext>molecules</mtext></math> of water. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&nbsp;is ______ (Round off to the Nearest Integer).<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mtext>Use</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>023</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>23</mn></msup><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>Atomic&#160;masses&#160;in</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>"
